{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_04.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every human has a Kasama \u2014 a dream-avatar that reflects their soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Kasama: The Awakening</i>, you\u2019ll step into the dreamworld as Orion, a spirit warrior on a quiet quest through the fading realm of Kastania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden truths, face your fears, and help restore balance to a world teetering between light and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short, heartfelt journey \u2014 perfect for players who love story-rich games like <i>Journey</i>, <i>Inside</i>, or <i>Oxenfree</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you dare to dream... and face the night with them?<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_10.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_03.png?t=1751024009\" /></div>Long ago, a sacred chestnut tree gave life to three mythical beings \u2014 protectors of the dreamworld and guides of the human soul:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Ipno</strong> \u2013 the firstborn, guardian of restful sleep for all living things.<br>\u2022 <strong>Morpheo</strong> \u2013 the middle child, who grants the power to dream and glimpse other realities.<br>\u2022 <strong>Phao</strong> \u2013 the youngest, who wakes beings from dreams and helps them carry meaning into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when the chestnuts that sustain this balance begin to vanish, the Kasamas grow weaker... and darkness creeps in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_6__2_.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_01.png?t=1751024009\" /></div>Walk through floating forests, forgotten ruins, and shimmering dreamscapes as you piece together Kastania\u2019s lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every place you visit reflects a feeling, a memory, or a fear \u2014 both personal and ancient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_7.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_02.png?t=1751024009\" /></div>Not all dreams are peaceful.<br>Some hold sorrow. Some conceal truths. Some fight back.<br>But only by facing them can you restore what was lost.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_9.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><br><br>Kasama: The Awakening</i> is the first chapter in a cinematic, episodic saga \u2014 built for one-night play sessions that leave a lasting impression.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3804190?t=1751024009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/f00941e3e3b8acb1741ccbcfd094fb368f367e05/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751024009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/2ad1fdf00216749f7341ab6538c05ea0a44193c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751024009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/2ad1fdf00216749f7341ab6538c05ea0a44193c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751024009","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_04.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every human has a Kasama \u2014 a dream-avatar that reflects their soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Kasama: The Awakening</i>, you\u2019ll step into the dreamworld as Orion, a spirit warrior on a quiet quest through the fading realm of Kastania.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover hidden truths, face your fears, and help restore balance to a world teetering between light and shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short, heartfelt journey \u2014 perfect for players who love story-rich games like <i>Journey</i>, <i>Inside</i>, or <i>Oxenfree</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you dare to dream... and face the night with them?<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_10.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_03.png?t=1751024009\" /></div>Long ago, a sacred chestnut tree gave life to three mythical beings \u2014 protectors of the dreamworld and guides of the human soul:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Ipno</strong> \u2013 the firstborn, guardian of restful sleep for all living things.<br>\u2022 <strong>Morpheo</strong> \u2013 the middle child, who grants the power to dream and glimpse other realities.<br>\u2022 <strong>Phao</strong> \u2013 the youngest, who wakes beings from dreams and helps them carry meaning into the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But when the chestnuts that sustain this balance begin to vanish, the Kasamas grow weaker... and darkness creeps in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_6__2_.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_01.png?t=1751024009\" /></div>Walk through floating forests, forgotten ruins, and shimmering dreamscapes as you piece together Kastania\u2019s lost history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every place you visit reflects a feeling, a memory, or a fear \u2014 both personal and ancient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_7.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Steam_Header_02.png?t=1751024009\" /></div>Not all dreams are peaceful.<br>Some hold sorrow. Some conceal truths. Some fight back.<br>But only by facing them can you restore what was lost.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/extras/Frame_9.png?t=1751024009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><br><br>Kasama: The Awakening</i> is the first chapter in a cinematic, episodic saga \u2014 built for one-night play sessions that leave a lasting impression.</p>","developers":["PIGIAMA KASAMA"],"dlc":[3804210],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804190/41647dce3fce3209adc4f96ac7f30edd555ac3c1/header.jpg?t=1751024009","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Monterey<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Silicon Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 687 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152386,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152386/movie480.mp4?t=1749717372","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152386/movie_max.mp4?t=1749717372"},"name":"Kasama The Awakening - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152386/a24acf55abaa7fc64d3c2de5dce1b79e3d964211/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749717372","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152386/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749717372","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152386/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749717372"}}],"name":"Kasama: The Awakening","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD ryzen 3 (2,6 Ghz) / Intel Core i5 (1.60 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>